on the full cohort. \texttt{+smoothnet}$\to$\texttt{BA+smoothnet} isolates the
bundle adjustment; \texttt{pipeline}$\to$\texttt{+smoothnet} isolates the
smoother; savgol shows whether the gain is SmoothNet or smoothing in general.
BLOCKED: needs \texttt{out/automq/score\_vs\_automq.csv} copied to this
machine --- only the \texttt{BA+smoothnet} rows are committed. Known from
\texttt{relax\_gate\_*.csv}: plain DLT $\to$ BA+SmoothNet helps 6 of 11
measures (median $+0.04$), all of it in the shape and derivative measures
(interjoint $0.22\to0.51$, abduction $0.59\to0.72$), and nothing in the
position measures, which plain DLT already scores at $0.89$--$1.00$.}

